<Layout title="Privacy | Math Worksheet Studio" description="Privacy information for the browser-based Math Worksheet Studio generator." canonicalPath="/privacy/"><div class="container"><article class="simple-copy"><h1>Privacy</h1><p>Math problems, generator settings and PDF files are produced in your browser. This website does not include user accounts, a grade database, advertising or analytics scripts in its initial release.</p><p>As with other websites, a hosting provider can process ordinary request metadata, such as IP addresses, to deliver site files. If advertising or analytics is enabled in the future, this page must be updated before those scripts go live.</p><p>We do not ask users to submit children's names, school identifiers, grades, or classroom records.</p><p>Contact email: <a href="mailto:contact@mathworksheetstudio.com">contact@mathworksheetstudio.com</a>. If you write to us, your email message and reply address are handled by your email service and the services used to route or receive our mail. Do not send student information or sensitive personal details.</p><p>Last reviewed: November 8, 2026.</p></article></div></Layout>
